401 Unauthorized: the URL form doesn't use the saved credentials. This means the source in your current user's config has no credentials, or you're in a different user context. Re-add it from this same PowerShell window, with single quotes around the values:
powershell
  dotnet nuget remove source telerik.com
  dotnet nuget add source https://nuget.telerik.com/v3/index.json --name telerik.com --username 'YOUR_EMAIL_OR_api-key' --password 'YOUR_PASSWORD_OR_KEY' --store-password-in-clear-text

Run dotnet nuget list source to confirm it appears, then restore.
